Backport of llvm/llvm-project 8e34b2cbb06a ("[libunwind][arm64e] Mach-O Support
unwinding PAuth_LR frames", #202772) to libunwind 19.1.4.

macOS system libraries on Apple M6 use compact unwind mode 5,
UNWIND_ARM64_MODE_FRAME_PAUTH_LR, which this libunwind otherwise rejects with
"stepWithCompactEncoding - invalid compact unwind encoding" and abort().

Differences from upstream: libunwind 19 has no authenticated (arm64e) unwinding,
so setIPPAuthLR stores the return address as is (in an arm64 process the PAC
instructions are no-ops and the saved LR is unsigned), and the
_LIBUNWIND_TARGET_AARCH64_AUTHENTICATED_UNWINDING changes to Registers.hpp and
DwarfInstructions.hpp are left out.

